      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 5.37,
          "en": "So, that's it for this course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.37,
          "end": 8.49,
          "en": "We learned a lot about React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.49,
          "end": 12.24,
          "en": "We built the first basic application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.24,
          "end": 15.51,
          "en": "where we can add our course goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.51,
          "end": 17.8,
          "en": "and whilst building this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.8,
          "end": 20.41,
          "en": "we learned a lot about building user interfaces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.41,
          "end": 22.253,
          "en": "with React Native, in general.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.22,
          "end": 25.14,
          "en": "You learned that you must use these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.14,
          "end": 27.94,
          "en": "built-in core components, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.94,
          "end": 31.1,
          "en": "You are not allowed to use HTML elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.1,
          "end": 33.82,
          "en": "like div's or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.82,
          "end": 36.76,
          "en": "Instead, you build the entire user interface",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.76,
          "end": 38.84,
          "en": "and all your custom components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.84,
          "end": 40.893,
          "en": "from those built-in components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.78,
          "end": 43.15,
          "en": "But then you can combine them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.15,
          "end": 47.053,
          "en": "as you need to, to build your own elements and features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.01,
          "end": 50.24,
          "en": "You also learned how styling works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.24,
          "end": 52.959,
          "en": "that you create such style sheet objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.959,
          "end": 55.33,
          "en": "which hold nested objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.33,
          "end": 56.49,
          "en": "which you can then assign",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.49,
          "end": 58.913,
          "en": "to different elements in your JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.86,
          "end": 64.56,
          "en": "In those nested objects, we have CSS-like properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.56,
          "end": 67.85,
          "en": "which allow us to set margins, paddings, colors,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.85,
          "end": 70.49,
          "en": "and all these things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.49,
          "end": 73.17,
          "en": "Now even though it looks a bit like CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.17,
          "end": 77.083,
          "en": "or the names are similar, it isn't CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.95,
          "end": 80.17,
          "en": "We have no inheritance and in general,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.17,
          "end": 82.95,
          "en": "it's just not CSS, it's JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.95,
          "end": 85.67,
          "en": "and under the hood, React Native translates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.67,
          "end": 89.75,
          "en": "our style settings to the Native style instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.75,
          "end": 91.57300000000001,
          "en": "for the different platforms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.86,
          "end": 94.97,
          "en": "We, for example, saw that we had problems",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.97,
          "end": 98.38,
          "en": "assigning rounded corners to these elements on iOS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.38,
          "end": 100.94,
          "en": "whereas it worked without issues on Android",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.94,
          "end": 102.56,
          "en": "and therefore, its really important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.56,
          "end": 105.507,
          "en": "to keep in mind that we have two different platforms",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.507,
          "end": 108.22,
          "en": "and React Native just does its best",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.22,
          "end": 110.21000000000001,
          "en": "to talk to both platforms",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.21000000000001,
          "end": 112.65299999999999,
          "en": "and transform our instructions for them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.89,
          "end": 116.02000000000001,
          "en": "Now, what we also of course learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.02000000000001,
          "end": 118.689,
          "en": "is that besides the components and the styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.689,
          "end": 122.62,
          "en": "we write regular React applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 122.62,
          "end": 126.32,
          "en": "We can still use state, we can react to events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.32,
          "end": 129.3,
          "en": "those events are just not called onclick,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.3,
          "end": 131.5,
          "en": "but instead onpress.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.5,
          "end": 134.4,
          "en": "But then we can react to them, we can change state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.4,
          "end": 137.2,
          "en": "we can output state and we can do all these things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.2,
          "end": 140.59,
          "en": "and this part, works exactly as you're used to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.59,
          "end": 142.52,
          "en": "There's nothing special about this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 142.52,
          "end": 147.52,
          "en": "React Native Plus React is exactly as React Web Plus React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 147.73,
          "end": 150.403,
          "en": "when it comes to managing state and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.57999999999998,
          "end": 153.07,
          "en": "Now, we saw differences",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 153.07,
          "end": 155.263,
          "en": "when it came to outputting lists though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.17000000000002,
          "end": 158.21,
          "en": "We did this with a scroll view,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.21,
          "end": 161.82999999999998,
          "en": "but then we switched to flat list for better performance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.82999999999998,
          "end": 165.14,
          "en": "Which is another built-in core component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.14,
          "end": 167.96,
          "en": "And you will see cases like this from time-to-time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.96,
          "end": 171.1,
          "en": "throughout the course, where we have a special solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.1,
          "end": 174.22,
          "en": "for the Native platforms for better performance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.22,
          "end": 176.603,
          "en": "or a Native look and feel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.6,
          "end": 179.98,
          "en": "But that's it for the basics for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.98,
          "end": 182.36,
          "en": "In the end it's not too complex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.36,
          "end": 186.44,
          "en": "it's a React app, just with a different target platform,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186.44,
          "end": 189.32,
          "en": "but of course it is something you must get used to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 189.32,
          "end": 191.47,
          "en": "Working with those built-in components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 191.47,
          "end": 193.3,
          "en": "setting up styling like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 193.3,
          "end": 196.37,
          "en": "It takes practice to get used to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.37,
          "end": 199.35,
          "en": "And thankfully we'll have plenty of practice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 199.35,
          "end": 200.36,
          "en": "throughout this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.36,
          "end": 203.49,
          "en": "because this was just the first real section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 203.49,
          "end": 205.31,
          "en": "and just the first app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 205.31,
          "end": 207.32,
          "en": "We're going to build way more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.32,
          "end": 209.24,
          "en": "and we're going to learn way more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 209.24,
          "end": 210.99,
          "en": "throughout the rest of this course.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
